// #483/#491, #1386 - Erebor's standcast (systems/specabilities.scp): one command switches it on and
// off. While on, every cast at a target in sight gets Erebor's level bonus against monsters
// (StandcastPlugin.CalculateLevelBonus, level alone, not ability points) and freezes the caster
// for the spell's cast time (CastFreezePlugin). Mage/Necromancer/Shaman by profession, no ability
// points (StandcastAbilityDef.Toggle). Not while the energy shield is up; raising a shield switches it off.
[StandcastAbilityDef a_standcast]
Name="Standcast"

PluginKey = @@standcast
PluginDef = p_standcast

[StandcastPluginDef p_standcast]

[function standcast]
a_standcast.Toggle(this)

[function cancelstandcast]
a_standcast.Deactivate(this)
